{"result":"ok","response":"collection","data":[{"id":"d2d22b38-4b3f-4ffb-9387-d18f870d5a91","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"ja-ro":"Nee-chan no Tomodachi ga Uzai Hanashi"},"altTitles":[{"ja":"\u59c9\u3061\u3083\u3093\u306e\u53cb\u9054\u304c\u3046\u3056\u3044\u8a71"},{"en":"My Older Sister's Friend Is Annoying"},{"vi":"B\u1ea1n th\u00e2n c\u1ee7a ch\u1ecb g\u00e1i t\u00f4i th\u1eadt phi\u1ec1n ph\u1ee9c"}],"description":{"en":"High school freshman Nao Misumi has known Sena Ikuta, his older sister Rio\u2019s best friend, since he was in elementary school. As a self-proclaimed \u201csister\u2019s boy\u201d, Nao has always found Sena\u2019s over-familiarity incredibly annoying. Yet, despite being loud, airheaded, and having zero sense of personal space, he could never truly bring himself to hate her. She has always looked out for him just as much as she has for Rio. \n\nShe\u2019s a total idiot, too carefree, and her sense of personal space is completely broken. To Nao, she\u2019s supposed to be nothing more than a nuisance, and yet... \n\n\u201cAt first, I hated her for sure. She was noisy, and always took the things I cherished. So why is it that now\u2014?\u201d \n\nEven as he grumbles about her constantly calling him \u201cLil bro,\" he finds himself unable to leave her alone. How did this \u201cannoying\u201d fixture in his life become the one person he can\u2019t look away from?","ja":"\u9ad8\u68211\u5e74\u751f\u306e\u4e09\u6f84\u5c1a\u306f\u3001\u59c9\u306e\u8389\u7dd2\u306e\u89aa\u53cb\u30fb\u751f\u7530\u702c\u90a3\u3068\u5c0f\u5b66\u751f\u306e\u9803\u304b\u3089\u306e\u77e5\u308a\u5408\u3044\u3002\u5f1f\u547c\u3073\u3059\u308b\u702c\u90a3\u3092\u9b31\u9676\u3057\u304f\u611f\u3058\u306a\u304c\u3089\u3082\u3001\u307b\u3063\u3068\u3051\u306a\u3044\u5b58\u5728\u3067\u2026\uff1f","vi":"Nao Misumi, h\u1ecdc sinh n\u0103m nh\u1ea5t c\u1ea5p ba, \u0111\u00e3 quen bi\u1ebft Sena Ikuta, c\u00f4 b\u1ea1n th\u00e2n c\u1ee7a ch\u1ecb g\u00e1i m\u00ecnh l\u00e0 Rio, t\u1eeb h\u1ed3i c\u00f2n h\u1ecdc ti\u1ec3u h\u1ecdc.\n\nL\u00e0 m\u1ed9t ng\u01b0\u1eddi t\u1ef1 nh\u1eadn m\u00ecnh l\u00e0 \"cu\u1ed3ng ch\u1ecb g\u00e1i\", Nao lu\u00f4n th\u1ea5y c\u1ef1c k\u1ef3 kh\u00f3 ch\u1ecbu tr\u01b0\u1edbc s\u1ef1 th\u00e2n thi\u1ebft qu\u00e1 m\u1ee9c c\u1ee7a Sena. Th\u1ebf nh\u01b0ng, d\u00f9 c\u00f4 l\u00fac n\u00e0o c\u0169ng \u1ed3n \u00e0o, h\u1eadu \u0111\u1eadu v\u00e0 ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n kh\u00f4ng bi\u1ebft gi\u1eef kho\u1ea3ng c\u00e1ch v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi kh\u00e1c, c\u1eadu l\u1ea1i ch\u1eb3ng th\u1ec3 n\u00e0o th\u1eadt s\u1ef1 gh\u00e9t n\u1ed5i c\u00f4.\n\nB\u1edfi Sena lu\u00f4n quan t\u00e2m \u0111\u1ebfn c\u1eadu ch\u1eb3ng k\u00e9m g\u00ec Rio.\n\nC\u00f4 \u1ea5y \u0111\u00fang l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t t\u00ean ng\u1ed1c. V\u00f4 t\u01b0 qu\u00e1 m\u1ee9c. M\u00e0 \u00fd th\u1ee9c v\u1ec1 kho\u1ea3ng c\u00e1ch c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n th\u00ec g\u1ea7n nh\u01b0 b\u1eb1ng kh\u00f4ng.\n\n\u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi Nao, \u0111\u00e1ng l\u1ebd c\u00f4 ch\u1ec9 n\u00ean l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t k\u1ebb phi\u1ec1n ph\u1ee9c m\u00e0 th\u00f4i.\n\nV\u1eady m\u00e0...\n\n\"L\u00fac \u0111\u1ea7u m\u00ecnh gh\u00e9t c\u00f4 \u1ea5y th\u1eadt. C\u00f4 \u1ea5y l\u00fac n\u00e0o c\u0169ng \u1ed3n \u00e0o, l\u1ea1i c\u00f2n lu\u00f4n l\u1ea5y m\u1ea5t nh\u1eefng th\u1ee9 m\u00ecnh tr\u00e2n qu\u00fd. V\u1eady m\u00e0 t\u1ea1i sao b\u00e2y gi\u1edd...\"\n\nD\u00f9 l\u00fac n\u00e0o c\u0169ng c\u00e0m r\u00e0m chuy\u1ec7n Sena c\u1ee9 g\u1ecdi m\u00ecnh l\u00e0 \"em trai\", Nao l\u1ea1i ch\u1eb3ng th\u1ec3 m\u1eb7c k\u1ec7 c\u00f4 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c.\n\nR\u1ed1t cu\u1ed9c t\u1eeb khi n\u00e0o \"k\u1ebb phi\u1ec1n ph\u1ee9c\" lu\u00f4n hi\u1ec7n di\u1ec7n trong cu\u1ed9c s\u1ed1ng c\u1ee7a c\u1eadu...\n\n...l\u1ea1i tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh ng\u01b0\u1eddi duy nh\u1ea5t khi\u1ebfn c\u1eadu kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 r\u1eddi m\u1eaft?"},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"162344","ap":"my-older-sisters-friend-is-annoying","bl":"20058998","bw":"series\/413885\/list","kt":"neechan-no-tomodachi-ga-uzai-hanashi","mu":"44mya0l","amz":"https:\/\/www.amazon.co.jp\/dp\/B0C5HTJWSD","cdj":"https:\/\/www.cdjapan.co.jp\/searchuni?fq.category=UD:14&q=\u59c9\u3061\u3083\u3093\u306e\u53cb\u9054\u304c\u3046\u3056\u3044\u8a71&order=reldesc&opt.exclude_prx=on","ebj":"https:\/\/ebookjapan.yahoo.co.jp\/books\/760826\/","mal":"156743","raw":"https:\/\/pocket.shonenmagazine.com\/episode\/4856001361581167471"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"","lastChapter":"","publicationDemographic":"shoujo","status":"ongoing","year":2022,"contentRating":"safe","tags":[{"id":"423e2eae-a7a2-4a8b-ac03-a8351462d71d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Romance"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"4d32cc48-9f00-4cca-9b5a-a839f0764984","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Comedy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"e5301a23-ebd9-49dd-a0cb-2add944c7fe9","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Slice of Life"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]}],"state":"published","chapterNumbersResetOnNewVolume":false,"createdAt":"2023-12-27T12:07:23+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-08-18T00:01:25+00:00","version":19,"availableTranslatedLanguages":["id","es-la","ru","pt-br","en","vi"],"latestUploadedChapter":"5ee94f76-b9d4-4a83-946a-1491651be369"},"relationships":[{"id":"c9b07aa7-5a29-4768-9690-a8166dde019c","type":"author"},{"id":"c9b07aa7-5a29-4768-9690-a8166dde019c","type":"artist"},{"id":"7c9fec7a-1ceb-463e-ac1b-5fa82a88d990","type":"cover_art","attributes":{"description":"","volume":"4","fileName":"9ade3c43-5399-447b-8dc5-f0119b1e41c0.jpg","locale":"ja","createdAt":"2026-05-22T13:24:05+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-05-22T13:24:05+00:00","version":1}},{"id":"5705813a-91fc-4f5a-af0d-b4f2c2a194f4","type":"manga","related":"main_story"},{"id":"b1a9ac33-4978-4fa9-a5ae-2cc728342dab","type":"manga","related":"shared_universe"},{"id":"f89d44b5-69df-4f17-8d68-c56a0bf